{"title": "Blightbringer (passive feature)", "pageid": 28076, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Blightbringer_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For the shortbow, see <a href=\"/wiki/Blightbringer\" title=\"Blightbringer\">Blightbringer</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Blightbringer</b> is a passive feature that deals extra damage against gnomes or dwarves.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Attacking <a href=\"/wiki/Gnome\" title=\"Gnome\">Gnomes</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Dwarf\" title=\"Dwarf\">Dwarves</a> with this weapon receives a 1d4 bonus to Attack and Damage rolls. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blightbringer\" title=\"Blightbringer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Shortbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shortbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Shortbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Shortbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Shortbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Shortbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Shortbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shortbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/46/Shortbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Blightbringer\" title=\"Blightbringer\">Blightbringer</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714211924\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 850/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6578/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1422/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 689021/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.335      1 -total\n 98.70%   30.926      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 60.12%   18.839      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 46.94%   14.710      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 44.06%   13.807      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 22.72%    7.119      1 Template:Item_icon\n 11.93%    3.738      1 Template:PageSeo\n 11.04%    3.460      1 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.40%    2.944      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  7.59%    2.378      2 Template:ItemIcon_Internal\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28076-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714211924 and revision id 213232. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}